<title>SRI LANKA: Lankem Dev Ltd in bonus, rights issue.</title>
<headline>Lankem Dev Ltd in bonus, rights issue.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's Lankem Developments Ltd on Friday announced a bonus and a rights issue of shares.</p>
<p>&quot;Lankem Developments has announced a three for one bonus issue and a one for one rights issue at 20 rupees,&quot; a company statement said.</p>
<p>The company's issued capital of 150,000 ordinary shares will rise to 1.2 million shares after the bonus and the rights issue.</p>
<p>The company's 10-rupees shares were last traded at 65 rupees on January 28. Lankem Developments is listed in the construction and engineering sector of the Colombo Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
